<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Jona</book>
  <para style="h">Jona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jona</para>
  <para style="mt">Jona</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Amitaia fapa Jona hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho la, khawpui ropui tak, Ninevi-ah chuan kal la, an sualna chuan ka hma a lo thleng ta tih hrilh rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jona chu a tho va, Lalpa tlân bosan tumin Tarsis lam a pan ta a. Joppa khuaah a chhuk a, Tarsis pan tûr lawng a hmu a, chuan man a pe a, Lalpa tlân bosan tumin Tarsis-a kal tûrte zîngah lawngah chuan a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan tuifinriatah thlipui na tak a tlehtîr a, thli a nat êm avângin lawng chu a keh dâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lawngpute chuan an hlau va, mahni pathian an au ta ṭheuh va. Lawng tizâng tûrin bungruate chu tuiah an paih a. Jona erawh chu lawng pindan chhûngrilah a lût thla a, tah chuan tui takin a muhîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lawng hotupa chu a hnênah a lo kal a, “Engtiziaa lo muhîl reng nge i nih? Tho la, i Pathian au ve rawh, ani chuan kan boral loh nân min ngaihtuah mahna,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An za chuan an inrâwn a, “Hawh u, he thil ṭha lo kan chunga lo thleng hi tu vâng nge tih hriat nân ṭhum i vâwr ang u,” an ti a. Tichuan, ṭhum an vâwr a, an ṭhumvâwr chu Jona chungah a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Jona hnênah, “Kan chunga thil ṭha lo lo thleng hi tu vâng nge, khawngaih takin min hrilh teh; eng hna thawk mi nge i nih, khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih, khawii rama mi nge i nih, eng hnam nge i nih?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Hebrai mi ka ni a, tuifinriat leh khawmual siamtu, vân Pathian, Lalpa betu ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mite chuan an hlau lehzual a, a hnênah, “Eng pawi nge i khawih?” an ti a. Pathian tlân bosan tum a ni tih a sawi an lo hre tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Tuifinriat fâwn a reh theih nân engtin nge kan tih ang che?” an ti a. Tuifinriat chu a fâwn nasa tawlh tawlh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Mi la kâng ula, tuifinriatah mi paih rawh u; tichuan, tui fâwn a reh mai ang. Keimah avângin he thlipui na tak hian a rawn nuai che u a ni tih ka hre reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lawng mite chuan lawng chu vaukam thlenpui hrâm tuma theihtâwp an chhuah pawhin an thei lo, tuifinriat lah chu a hma aiin a fâwn nasa tawlh tawlh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chu an au va, “Aw Lalpa , he mi nunna kan lâk avâng hian min tiboral lul suh ang che. Aw Lalpa , nangin ṭha i tih angin thil i ti ṭhîn a, pawi khawih lo thisen mawh hi kan chungah nghat suh ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jona chu an la kâng a, tuifinriatah chuan an paih ta a; tuifinriat fâwn bulh bulh chu a reh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan Lalpa chu an hlau ta êm êm a, a hnênah an inthawi a, thute an tiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chuan Jona dawlh tûr sangha lian pui a lo ruat diam a; tichuan, Jona chu sangha kawchhûngah chuan ni thum leh zân thum a awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jona chu sangha kawchhûng aṭang chuan a Pathian, Lalpa hnênah heti hian a ṭawngṭai a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka mangan tâwpah Lalpa ka ko va, Anin min chhâng a, Seol aṭangin ka au va, Nangin ka aw i lo hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuifinriat mawng, a thûk laiah Nangin min paih lût a, Tuite chuan min khuh hlup hlup a, I tuifâwnte leh tui inchhawkte chuan min vûr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei chuan, ‘I hnên ata min hnawt chhuak a, I in thianghlim ka hmu dâwn tawh lo a nih hi,’ Ka lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuite chuan min chîm pil a, Ka vêlin tuithûkpui chuan min hual a, Tuifinriat hnimte chuan ka lu a phuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlâng innghahnaahte ka tla lût a, Lei hnuai khura tâng reng tûrin. Mahse, aw Lalpa , ka Pathian, Nangin khur thûk ata chu min la chhuak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thi mai dâwna ka inhriat lai khân Lalpa chu ka hre reng a, Ka ṭawngṭaina chu i biak in thianghlimah I hnên a lo thleng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eng mah ni lo milem betute chu I lakah an rinawm ta lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan fak hla sa-in Inthawina ka hlân ang che, Ka thutiam chu ka hlen ang, Chhandamtu chu Lalpa a ni si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan sangha chu thu a pe a, khawmualah Jona chu a law chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Jona hnênah a lo thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho la, khaw ropui tak Ninevi-ah chuan va kal la, i hnêna ka sawi ang khân va hril rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Jona chu a tho va, Lalpa thu angin Ninevi khuaah chuan a kal ta a. Ninevi chu khaw ropui tak, a zau lam pawh ni thum kal laia zau a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jona chuan ni khat kal chin khawpui chu a fang ṭan a, heti hian a au va: “Tûn aṭanga ni sawmli-ah Ninevi khua hi tihchhiat vek a ni dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ninevi mite chuan Pathian an ring ta a, chaw nghei nân awmni an kham a, a tê ber aṭanga a lian ber thlengin saiip puan an sin ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ninevi lalin chu chu a lo hriat chuan a lalṭhutthlêng a thawhsan a, a lal thuam a hlîp a, saiip a sin a, vaivutah a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ninevi khaw lal leh miliante chuan hetiang hian thupêk an chhuah a: “Mihring te, ran te, bâwng rual te, berâm rual te chuan eng mah an tem tûr a ni lo, an eiin an in tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihring leh rante chuan saiip puan sin sela, ṭhahnemngai takin Lalpa au rawh se. Mi zawng zawngin an sual hawisan sela, râwng takin che tawh suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan boral loh nân Pathianin a thinur nasa tak la kîrin mi khawngaih lo vang tih tu nge hria?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathianin an awm dân chu a hmu a, thil sual tih an sim tih a hria a. Pathian chuan a khawngaih a, an chunga chhiatna thlentîr a tum chu a ṭhulh a, a ti ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jona erawh chu a lâwm lo hle a, a thin a rim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah hetiang hian a ṭawngṭai a: “Aw Lalpa , hetiang hian i ti leh si ang tih ka rama ka awm lai pawh khân ka sawi lo vem ni? Chuvâng alâwm Tarsis lamah ka tlân vat ni. Nang hi zawng khawngaihna leh lainatnaa khat, Pathian thinnel leh hmangaiha khat, chhiatna thlentîr duh lo i ni miau tih ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tûnah ka nun hi la mai teh, ka tân thih hi dam aiin a ṭha zâwk si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “I thinrim hi dik i ti maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jona chu khawpui aṭang chuan a chhuak a, khawpui chhak lamah a ṭhu a. Tah chuan bûk a sa a, a hlim aṭang chuan khawpuiah thil eng nge lo thleng dâwn tih hmuh a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian, Lalpa chuan ûm a ṭotîr a, Jona lu zâr hliaha amah tihahdam tûrin a zâmtîr a. Chu ûm hlim avâng chuan Jona chu a lâwm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tûk khua a lo vâr chuan Pathianin sûlrûl a tîr a, ûm chu a ei a, a vuai ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni a lo chhuak a, Pathianin khawchhak thli lum a tlehtîr a, ni chuan Jona chhîpah a em a, luhaiin a chau ta a. Thih a dîl leh ta a, “Ka tân dam aiin thih a ṭha zâwk e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian chuan Jona hnênah, “Ûm chungchânga i thinur hi a dik em ni?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Thih ngam meuhva ka thinur hi ka tidik a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />LALPA chuan a hnênah, “He ûm, i tuh pawh ni lo, i ṭhantîr pawh ni lo, zânkhat thil thu-a lo ṭhang liana, a tûka thi leh ta mai mah hi i lainat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ninevi khaw ropui takah hian mihring nuaikhat leh sînghnih lai, an ding leh vei pawh hre lo, ran rual tam tak nên an awm a, chûng chu ka khawngaih lo vang em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
</usx>
